Description: Local, offline metadata cleaner and AI-tag remover for images, text/Markdown,
 HTML, SVG, PDF, Office documents, and MP3/MP4/M4A/MOV audio-video.
 A local, offline metadata cleaner and AI-tag remover for images
 (JPEG/PNG/WebP/BMP/GIF/TIFF), text/Markdown, HTML, SVG, PDF, Office documents
 (DOCX/XLSX/PPTX), and audio/video (MP3/MP4/M4A/MOV). Strips EXIF, GPS, XMP,
 IPTC, C2PA content credentials, and AI-generator signatures from images;
 invisible-Unicode steganography and AI-identifying frontmatter/meta tags/editor
 metadata from text/Markdown/HTML/SVG; the /Info dictionary and XMP metadata
 streams from PDF; author/company/tracking properties from Office documents; and
 ID3/iTunes-style metadata from MP3/MP4/M4A/MOV. Accepts directories via
 --recursive. Includes real AI super-resolution upscaling (Real-ESRGAN) and a
 local drag-and-drop web UI (`metaclean serve`). No network calls, no upload —
 everything runs on your machine.

